The Tribunal adopted a balanced approach and keeping in view factors like : (i) the payment of monthly installment of Rs.11,550/-
towards loan of the tractor;
(ii) Maintaining a family comprising of wife, two minor children and parents;
(iii) Affording tractor and motorcycle; (iv) that the deceased was working as a contractor; assessed his income at Rs.25,000/- per month.
